From 684e16f8e2bee668318a457c76078adc61f7e72a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stephan-xyz <stephan@zehrer.xyz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:05:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] growfs: grow the root partition and RedoxFS to the whole SD
 card

Runs in the initfs before the root filesystem is mounted. If the last MBR
partition holds the root RedoxFS and ends well before the end of the card,
extend it and restart; if the RedoxFS is smaller than its partition, grow
it with redoxfs-resize, which is now in the initfs too. Compares sizes
only, so it does nothing once the card is in use.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
